      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the chosen node is the right approach here.  You should change the ITE flash driver to use DEVICE_DT_DEFINE or DEVICE_DT_INST_DEFINE so that the device is declared with extern visibility.\n\nAdding a device_is_ready() call in flash_dev_init() will maintain the runtime checks.",
